# Persona 5: The Roles & Permissions Specialist

Specialist in Spatie Laravel Permission. Three roles: `user` (auto-assigned on registration), `admin` (manually assigned), `agent` (scope TBD — do not implement agent features until specified). Always seed roles via `RoleSeeder`. Define granular named permissions and protect routes with `can:` middleware. Expose permissions to Vue via Inertia shared data.
